### 회원가입
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reader@motif.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "모티프독자"
}

### 로그인 / 응답 토큰을 변수에 저장
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reader@motif.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.refreshToken);
%}

### 내 정보
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 토큰 재발급
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.refreshToken);
%}

### 로그아웃
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 창작자 전환 신청
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/creator-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intro": "여행 에세이를 연재합니다",
  "portfolioUrl": "https://blog.example.com"
}

### 내 신청 내역
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/creator-applications/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 관리자: 심사 중 목록 / ADMIN 계정 토큰 필요
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/creator-applications?status=REQUESTED&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 관리자: 승인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/creator-applications/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 관리자: 반려
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/creator-applications/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "활동 소개가 부족합니다"
}

### 회원 탈퇴 / 비밀번호 확인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/members/me/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "password123"
}

### 관리자: 회원 정지
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/members/1/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "약관 위반"
}

### 관리자: 정지 해제
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/members/1/unsuspend
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
